 wrongdoers","p":"N","tr":"l-ẓālimūna","f":["ACT","PCPL","MP","NOM"],"r":24,"l":89,"g":[["ٱل","DET","prefix","Al"],["ظَّـٰلِ","N","stem","ACT|PCPL|MP|NOM"]]},{"i":"14:42:8","a":"إِنَّمَا","t":"Only","p":"ACC","tr":"innamā","l":5,"g":[["إِنَّ","ACC","stem",""],["مَا","PREV","stem",""]]},{"i":"14:42:9","a":"يُؤَخِّرُهُمْ","t":"He gives them respite","p":"V","tr":"yu-akhiruhum","f":["IMPF","(II)","3MS"],"r":36,"l":618,"g":[["يُؤَخِّرُ","V","stem","IMPF|(II)|3MS"],["هُمْ","PRON","suffix","PRON:3MP"]]},{"i":"14:42:10","a":"لِيَوْمٍۢ","t":"to a Day","p":"N","tr":"liyawmin","f":["M","INDEF","GEN"],"r":13,"l":25,"g":[["لِ","P","prefix","l:P"],["يَوْمٍۢ","N","stem","M|INDEF|GEN"]]},{"i":"14:42:11","a":"تَشْخَصُ","t":"will stare","p":"V","tr":"tashkhaṣu","f":["IMPF","3FS"],"r":1057,"l":4306},{"i":"14:42:12","a":"فِيهِ","t":"in it","p":"P","tr":"fīhi","l":3,"g":[["فِي","P","stem",""],["هِ","PRON","suffix","PRON:3MS"]]},{"i":"14:42:13","a":"ٱلْأَبْصَـٰرُ","t":"the eyes","p":"N","tr":"l-abṣāru","f":["MP","NOM"],"r":74,"l":247,"g":[["ٱلْ","DET","prefix","Al"],["ْأَبْ","N","stem","MP|NOM"]]},{"e":"٤٢","v":"14:42"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"14:34","t":"And He gave you from all you asked of Him. And if you should count the favor [i.e., blessings] of Allāh, you could not enumerate them. Indeed, mankind is [generally] most unjust and ungrateful.","j":13,"h":26,"s":14,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"14:35","t":"And [mention, O Muḥammad], when Abraham said, \"My Lord, make this city [i.e., Makkah] secure and keep me and my sons away from worshipping idols.","j":13,"h":26,"s":14,"a":35,"sd":null},{"k":"14:36","t":"My Lord, indeed they have led astray many among the people. So whoever follows me - then he is of me; and whoever disobeys me - indeed, You are [yet] Forgiving and Merciful.","j":13,"h":26,"s":14,"a":36,"sd":null},{"k":"14:37","t":"Our Lord, I have settled some of my descendants in an uncultivated valley near Your sacred House, our Lord, that they may establish prayer. So make hearts among the people incline toward them and provide for them from the fruits that they might be grateful.","j":13,"h":26,"s":14,"a":37,"sd":null},{"k":"14:38","t":"Our Lord, indeed You know what we conceal and what we declare, and nothing is hidden from Allāh on the earth or in the heaven.","j":13,"h":26,"s":14,"a":38,"sd":null},{"k":"14:39","t":"Praise to Allāh, who has granted to me in old age Ishmael and Isaac. Indeed, my Lord is the Hearer of supplication.","j":13,"h":26,"s":14,"a":39,"sd":null},{"k":"14:40","t":"My Lord, make me an establisher of prayer, and [many] from my descendants. Our Lord, and accept my supplication.","j":13,"h":26,"s":14,"a":40,"sd":null},{"k":"14:41","t":"Our Lord, forgive me and my parents and the believers the Day the account is established.\"","j":13,"h":26,"s":14,"a":41,"sd":null},{"k":"14:42","t":"And never think that Allāh is unaware of what the wrongdoers do. He only delays them [i.e., their account] for a Day when eyes will stare [in horror].","j":13,"h":26,"s":14,"a":42,"sd":null}],"juz":13,"hizb":26,"surahs":[14],"sajdah":false}